          "guid": "msphg6w61thh2173",
          "message": {
            "text": "The routine face-selection sample is composed with the existing cluster/webfont and variable-axis logical oracles on each OS. The disabled cluster arm must fail, turning helper-path movement into a gate condition instead of a diagnostic suggestion; locally the default arm passed 9/9, the disabled arm moved four cells, and the variable-axis pair passed 8/8.",
            "markdown": "The routine face-selection sample is composed with the existing cluster/webfont and variable-axis logical oracles on each OS. The disabled cluster arm must fail, turning helper-path movement into a gate condition instead of a diagnostic suggestion; locally the default arm passed 9/9, the disabled arm moved four cells, and the variable-axis pair passed 8/8."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": ".github/workflows/font-conformance-synthetic.yml"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 213,
                  "endLine": 221,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "          CP_TOTAL: ${{ inputs.cp_total }}\n      - name: Secondary logical parity matrix (clusters, webfonts, variable axes)\n        if: matrix.shard == 1\n        run: |\n          npm run fonts:cluster-conformance\n          if DOMOTION_CLUSTER_FALLBACK=0 npm run fonts:cluster-conformance; then\n            echo \"::error::cluster fallback negative control did not move\"\n            exit 1\n          fi"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
